Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Treat AX keyboard (type 7) like 101 when auto-detecting

From np21w-rev107-key101.diff (win9x/np2.cpp, win9x/winkbd.cpp).
---
 win9x/np2.cpp    |   4 +-
 win9x/winkbd.cpp | 155 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 156 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/win9x/np2.cpp b/win9x/np2.cpp
